<title>UK: CAR sets 1.5 billion French franc 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>CAR sets 1.5 billion French franc 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and CCBP.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE AUTONOME DE REFINANCEMENT</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.8	 MATURITY    21.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.70    PAY DATE    21.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.3	 REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5	   GOV LAW     FRENCH</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
